# What this job needs, by PATH (format `<path> <name>`, relative to this dir).
#
# test-stack  the image this fan-out itself runs in. It is the tools' image, so
#             this script inherits nix and the grants — which it does not use,
#             but running the orchestrator somewhere else would mean a third
#             image for no gain.
# run-test    named so the entry is present for `eval-path-then --eval=` to
#             resolve into the image each TEST runs in. That one carries no
#             grants, which is the whole reason it is separate.
../../dev/test-stack test-stack
../../dev/run-test run-test
